    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3302\">You temporarily suspend divine or pseudo-divine authority.</p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +1</p><p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3349\">Choose a target manifesting power granted by:</p><ul data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3418\"><li data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3357\"><p data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3357\">A god</p></li><li data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3373\"><p data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3373\">A thoughtform</p></li><li data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3393\"><p data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3393\">A divine contract</p></li><li data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3418\"><p data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3418\">A metaphysical mandate</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3473\">You may suppress those granted abilities temporarily.</p><h3 data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3483\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3545\">Spend 1–2 Civic Charge dice (scale by magnitude of divinity).</p><h3 data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3557\">Effect</h3><ul data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3640\"><li data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3598\"><p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3598\">Divine abilities fail or become inert.</p></li><li data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3640\"><p data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3640\">The source may resist (GM adjudicated).</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3654\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3694\">This always generates backlash. Always.</p><p data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3766\">Divine counter-investigations, mandate challenges, celestial scrutiny.</p><p data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3805\"></p>",
